tising</p><p>&middot; Facilitate purchases of Activision products or services</p><p>&middot; Interact with Customer Service</p><p>&middot; Detect security incidents and secure our Properties</p><p>&middot; Undertaking activities to verify and maintain the quality of our service, such as preventing cheating and bad behavior</p><p>For improvement of users' game experience and management of users' in-game relationship, non-identifiable data along with Display name (Activision ID) may be disclosed to other users through open API or in-game interface, including game data generated during user's usage of Activision's services.</p></td></tr><tr><td ><p>PERIOD OF RETENTION AND USAGE</p><p>Activision will hold your personal information until termination of service.</p><p>In addition, if Activision needs to retain such data to comply with relevant laws or regulations, Activision will retain the data for the period set under such laws or regulations.</p><p>For any privacy policy or personal data-related inquiries, please send an e-mail to privacy@activision.com.</p></td></tr><tr><td ><p>Notification for Personal Data Overseas Transfer</p><p>Activision transfer collected personal data overseas as below, and this is essential for service.</p><p><strong>For Stable Service Provision</strong></p><ul><li>Company: Amazon.com Inc. (location: United States, contact: Amazon Customer Service <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/contact-us/?nc1=h_ls\">https://aws.amazon.com/contact-us/?nc1=h_ls</a>), Google LLC (location: United States, contact: Google Cloud Customer Service <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/contact\">https://cloud.google.com/contact</a>)</li><li>Items: any personal data collected during your use of service</li><li>Period: until termination of agreement</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>",
